  _recipeBookDescriptionUnspoiled: 
  _recipeBookDescriptionSpoiled: "This is a madman's ingenious dish, specially designed
    to obliterate one's culinary desire to smithereens, yet it is simply a chunk
    of bread with cured fatty meat on top of it. So what is the secret ingredient?
    When asking the supplier on the meat's origins, he would only suggest that it
    is \"worth chewing with friends over\". It is also worth mentioning that the
    supplier\u2019s headquarters are strategically located next to an abandoned morgue,
    once active during the war. Dinner guests better watch out, lest they reunite
    with their loved ones again at the most inconvenient of times. "
